<title>CANADA: Emco Ltd announces C$3.6 mln issuer bid.</title>
<headline>Emco Ltd announces C$3.6 mln issuer bid.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON, Ontario 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Emco Ltd said on Wednesday that it has filed a notice of intention to make an issuer bid for up to C$3.6 million of its outstanding 7.25 percent convertible subordinated debentures.</p>
<p>Emco said in a statement that C$73.5 million of the debentures due April 30, 2002 is currently outstanding.</p>
<p>Purchases under the bid may be carried out between November 4, 1996 and November 3, 1997. Any purchases will be made in the over-the-counter market at prices to be negotiated, Emco said.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
